    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606340/extras/7f0a887ce4078fe4950c1734abedf577.avif?t=1754446753\" width=548 height=160 /></span>\u00a0Procedural, hack and slash, scythe spinning, bullet-hell, hoard reaping action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Reap the harvest and gather souls.\u00a0<br><br>-Spend souls to unlock various ability nodes<br><br>-Seven Playable Reaper Types.\u00a0 Each unique with their own differentiated scythes and movement stats.<br><br>-Hand drawn, pen &amp; paper aesthetics merged with pixel graphics and human made sound design.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606340/extras/7f0a887ce4078fe4950c1734abedf577.avif?t=1754446753\" width=548 height=160 /></span>\u00a0Procedural, hack and slash, scythe spinning, bullet-hell, hoard reaping action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Reap the harvest and gather souls.\u00a0<br><br>-Spend souls to unlock various ability nodes<br><br>-Seven Playable Reaper Types.\u00a0 Each unique with their own differentiated scythes and movement stats.<br><br>-Hand drawn, pen &amp; paper aesthetics merged with pixel graphics and human made sound design.</p>",
